# Politburo UI styling

Authoritative guide: `docs/politburo/development/styling-guide.md`.

## Rules

- Colours, shadows, blur, and backdrop images live in `static/css/tokens.css` only.
- Prefer shared classes in `components.css` over page-local CSS.
- Glass is the default for `.panel`, `.tabs--nav`, `.data-table`, `.topbar` on app pages.
- Controls (`.input`, `.select`, `.btn`, `.icon-btn`) stay on solid `--bg-surface-elevated`.

## App page skeleton

```html
<header class="page-header">
  <h1 class="page-header__title">Title</h1>
</header>
<div class="section-layout">
  <nav class="tabs tabs--nav">…</nav>
  <section class="panel stack">…</section>
</div>
```

## Assets

Brand images under `static/brand/`; reference as `/static/brand/...` in tokens (CDN-cached).

## Before finishing

- Run `go test ./internal/ui/...` from `services/politburo/`.
- Do not reintroduce `.panel--glass`, `.admin-layout`, or raw hex/rgba in non-token CSS.
